--- OLD
@OptionChosen:              ; Jumps here when the player presses A or Start (selected an option)
    LDA cursor              ;  this CMP will set C if they selected option 1 (New Game)
    CMP #1                  ;  and will clear C if they selected option 0 (Continue)
    RTS                     ;  then exit!
--- NEW
@OptionChosen:              ; Jumps here when the player presses A or Start (selected an option)
    LDA cursor
    CMP #2
    BNE @RealChoice         ; the mode row is not a way out of this screen

    ;  Pressing A on a mode opens the settings screen and switches to Custom,
    ;  seeded from whatever mode was showing -- so "start from Deluxe and
    ;  change two things" is the natural path in rather than a special case.
    JSL opt_settings + OPTFAR

    ;  Come back through the top of the title screen rather than into its
    ;  loop: TitleScreen_Copyright calls IntroTitlePrepare, which reloads the
    ;  menu CHR the settings screen overwrote and clears the nametable.
    JMP EnterTitleScreen

  @RealChoice:
    CMP #1                  ;  this CMP will set C if they selected option 1 (New Game)
    RTS                     ;  and will clear C if they selected option 0 (Continue)
